# ABP Layered Web Application Template

## Solution Structure
```
MyProject/
├── src/
│   ├── MyProject.Domain.Shared      # Constants, enums, DTOs
│   ├── MyProject.Domain             # Entities, repositories, domain services
│   ├── MyProject.Application.Contracts  # App service interfaces, DTOs
│   ├── MyProject.Application        # App service implementations
│   ├── MyProject.EntityFrameworkCore   # EF Core, migrations
│   ├── MyProject.HttpApi            # REST controllers
│   ├── MyProject.HttpApi.Client     # HTTP client proxies
│   ├── MyProject.Web                # MVC/Razor/Blazor UI
│   └── MyProject.DbMigrator         # Migration console app
└── test/
    ├── MyProject.Domain.Tests
    ├── MyProject.Application.Tests
    └── MyProject.EntityFrameworkCore.Tests
```

## Layer Dependencies
- Domain.Shared: No ABP dependencies
- Domain: Depends on Domain.Shared
- Application.Contracts: Depends on Domain.Shared
- Application: Depends on Domain + Application.Contracts
- EF Core: Depends on Domain
- HttpApi: Depends on Application.Contracts only
- Web: Depends on HttpApi

## Key Configurations
- Connection strings in appsettings.json
- Module dependencies via [DependsOn]
- DbContext configuration
- AutoMapper profiles
- Permission definitions
